    "title": "Intersection floods in Northeast El Paso; police ask drivers to stay away - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Ibave ,\n7 hours ago\nEL PASO, Texas (KFOX14/CBS4) — Police are asking drivers to avoid a flooded intersection in Northeast El Paso after Thursday afternoon's rain. According to the El Paso Police Department, as of 3:50 p.m., flooding has been reported at the intersection of Gateway North and Vulcan (near Chapin High School).\nRead full article\n1",
